OL,3,ASome UK government services may be down
OL,4,Atemporarily, says No 10, due to global
OL,5,Acyber-security issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome UK government services may be down
OL,8,Ftemporarily, says Downing Street, due
OL,9,Fto a global cyber-security issue
OL,11,FIt says "no large public-facing
OL,12,Fcritical services are being affected",
OL,13,Fbut some "limited services may
OL,14,Ftemporarily be offline"
OL,16,FAround the world, organisations are
OL,17,Fscrambling to fix a critical
OL,18,Fcyber-security flaw that could affect
OL,19,Fmillions of websites
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
