OL,3,ACelebrity shark guided out of South
OL,4,AKorea canal refuses to swim out to sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA famed dusky shark in South Korea is
OL,7,Fstill lingering near a canal that it
OL,8,Fwas guided out of on Wednesday.
OL,10,FThe shark, nicknamed Bukangi, became an
OL,11,Funlikely sensation after it was spotted
OL,12,Fswimming in a canal in the
OL,13,Fsouth-eastern port city of Busan last
OL,14,Fmonth. For weeks, rescuers tried in
OL,15,Fvain to get it back to the open sea
OL,16,Fusing large nets.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1792668333
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACelebrity shark guided out of South
OL,4,AKorea canal refuses to swim out to sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, authorities said they had
OL,7,Freinforced barriers to prevent Bukangi
OL,8,Ffrom returning. But it has yet to swim
OL,9,Fout into the open sea, and has been
OL,10,Fcircling back repeatedly to the mouth
OL,11,Fof the waterway.
OL,13,FIts rescue prompted mixed reactions in
OL,14,FBusan, where some said the shark should
OL,15,Fstay while others felt it was better
OL,16,Ffor it to go.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
