OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATwo killed in attack on airport in
OL,4,Aeastern Saudi Arabia, authorities say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe GACA did not say what type of
OL,7,Fattack occurred, but Yemen's
OL,8,FIran-backed Houthi movement has
OL,9,Frepeatedly targeted the kingdom's
OL,10,Fairports with drones and missiles.
OL,12,FOn Wednesday morning, two people were
OL,13,Fkilled by debris from a drone that was
OL,14,Fintercepted over Eastern Province,
OL,15,Fwhere Dammam is located, the Saudi
OL,16,Fenergy ministry said.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
