OL,3,APolice investigate Married at First
OL,4,ASight Australia after 'inappropriate'
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is the latest blow for the show,
OL,8,Fafter a BBC News investigation earlier
OL,9,Fthis year into MAFS Australia revealed
OL,10,Fcast members said they had not been
OL,11,Ftold their partners had previous drug
OL,12,Fand violence convictions.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
